      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After a horror install gone wrong that we had removed, we engaged Zac for a replacement system.He was prompt, and friendly when he came to inspect the property before starting the quote and spent time asking what we wanted to achieve, what the options were and what he could suggest and then prepared a detailed quote. A total difference to our previous experience, all options were included and detailed in pricing, extra work that we discussed was detailed and quoted. The expected performance was detailed.He came buy the week before the install to look over the site and explain what would happen. The system was installed over a day and a half with care and precision, compered to the 5 hour rush job we experienced previously. Zac spent time with us explaining the Fronius Inverter panel, and the Solar Analytics software and is coming back in a week to review and follow up.This young man and his team were punctual, friendly, clean and professional at every point.We are extremely happy with the quality of the products that he supplied and the workmanship that went into preparing and uninstalling the equipment.",
